{"id":633,"slug":"i-know-where-i-m-going","title":"I Know Where I’m Going!","year":1945,"country":"United Kingdom","duration":92,"spine":94,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/633-i-know-where-i-m-going","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/release_boxshots/5528-5549dee68264bbb785a343dd06daa24a/PgGnPrl0Zlfz4jdOFx8sbDFown8Y5u_original.jpg","description":"Love flourishes in the Scottish Hebrides in this windswept enchantment from British cinema’s most passionate visionaries, Michael Powell and Emeric Pressburger. “I know where I’m going!” declares headstrong, upwardly mobile Joan Webster (Wendy Hiller) en route to her marriage to a wealthy industrialist—until her carefully laid plans are blown away by a raging storm that leaves her stranded on an island off the Scottish coast with a dashing naval officer (Roger Livesey). Shot in ethereal black and white that enhances the almost mystical air of its setting—a folkloric world where legends and curses still hold sway—this beloved romance is one of cinema’s most stirring expressions of the eternal conflict between the head and the heart.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Michael Powell","slug":"michael-powell"},{"name":"Emeric Pressburger","slug":"emeric-pressburger"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Wendy Hiller","role":"Joan Webster","slug":"wendy-hiller"},{"actor":"Roger Livesey","role":"Torquil MacNeil","slug":"roger-livesey"},{"actor":"Pamela Brown","role":"Catriona","slug":"pamela-brown"},{"actor":"Finlay Currie","role":"Ruairidh Mhór","slug":"finlay-currie"},{"actor":"George Carney","role":"Mr. Webster","slug":"george-carney"},{"actor":"Nancy Price","role":"Mrs. Crozier","slug":"nancy-price"},{"actor":"Catherine Lacey","role":"Mrs. Robinson","slug":"catherine-lacey"},{"actor":"Jean Cadell","role":"Postmistress","slug":"jean-cadell"},{"actor":"John Laurie","role":"John Campbell","slug":"john-laurie"},{"actor":"Valentine Dyall","role":"Mr. Robinson","slug":"valentine-dyall"},{"actor":"Norman Shelley